            {
                "entry_id": "7646c033-9d20-3bfc-bc07-80e926664df5",
                "word": "témoignesse",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "17fea1e2-ab61-47cc-ac57-76ec4d4380eb",
                        "entry_id": "7646c033-9d20-3bfc-bc07-80e926664df5",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "témoignesses"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "dd8d70a1-c891-4a1e-a2b9-a8d92e10dfc6",
                        "entry_id": "7646c033-9d20-3bfc-bc07-80e926664df5",
                        "tags": [
                            "masculine"
                        ],
                        "form": "témoin"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b47a6aaf-ee78-30cf-816c-4a65f714ad3a",
                        "entry_id": "7646c033-9d20-3bfc-bc07-80e926664df5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celle qui certifie ou qui peut certifier une chose qu’elle a vue ou entendue."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "rare"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bae98534-e76c-42e7-9978-97e2318dd7b5",
                                "sense_id": "b47a6aaf-ee78-30cf-816c-4a65f714ad3a",
                                "text": "La Machine à répertorier les failles, se signalant à elle seule toute la fragilité de sa base semnique et son aptitude prémonitoire à présenter des excuses, « conseille » à la Machine à blesser l’homme urtiqué dans son bien-être, […] d’accepter de se déclarer enfin témoignesse parmi les témoins"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "19312aa5-0d6c-400e-a0ea-524f44848e20",
                        "source_entry_id": "7646c033-9d20-3bfc-bc07-80e926664df5",
                        "source_sense_id": "b47a6aaf-ee78-30cf-816c-4a65f714ad3a",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zeugin",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zeugin",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ee914e4-62ed-3a10-ae50-b9ab07d47fb3",
                                        "entry_id": "d1ddd13d-0a58-3704-a3bf-3b814ad190c3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "weibliche Person, die etwas bestimmtes gesehen oder auf andere Art wahrgenommen hat und dies auch bestätigen kann/könnte"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0bc2a109-ef99-4dcf-99a5-d1a2af7acce1",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee914e4-62ed-3a10-ae50-b9ab07d47fb3",
                                                "text": "Die Zeuginnen beobachteten die Schlägerei auf der Damentoilette."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dcdc5a75-27a8-4ef1-a3a1-e4623b6342de",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee914e4-62ed-3a10-ae50-b9ab07d47fb3",
                                                "text": "„Der Vorsitzende sieht die Zeugin durchdringend an.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55df43b2-6126-4ac7-a8c2-46d63955a278",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee914e4-62ed-3a10-ae50-b9ab07d47fb3",
                                                "text": "„Sie konnte nicht als Zeugin vor Gericht aussagen, keine Verträge abschließen oder ihren Besitz vererben.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e5f5b39-a3ee-4b11-abf5-dc4b3a87edad",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee914e4-62ed-3a10-ae50-b9ab07d47fb3",
                                                "text": "„Niemand rief sie als Zeugin auf.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9078117-e1f1-4fa3-8b10-b97590f085bb",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee914e4-62ed-3a10-ae50-b9ab07d47fb3",
                                                "text": "Die Zeugin setzte sich, ihre Handtasche stellte sie auf den Boden. Sie müsse sich nicht äußern, weil sie die Ehefrau des Angeklagten sei, sagte der Richter, aber wenn sie es doch tue, müsse es die Wahrheit sein."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "031f9540-3b21-4fbf-9353-2112f1f84a62",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee914e4-62ed-3a10-ae50-b9ab07d47fb3",
                                                "text": "Der Jugendliche habe das Mädchen, das in Begleitung war, in der Kosmetikabteilung attackiert, sagte eine Zeugin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce5b0361-1bf0-4823-b64c-7cb2b0c9d217",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee914e4-62ed-3a10-ae50-b9ab07d47fb3",
                                                "text": "Gleich mehrere Künstlerinnen haben in einem offenen Brief schwere Vorwürfe gegen den Dirigenten und Leiter der Tiroler Festspiele Erl, Gustav Kuhn, erhoben. Als \"Betroffene\", \"Zeuginnen\" oder \"Mitwissende\" bezeichnen sich die Verfasserinnen dabei und sprechen von \"anhaltendem Machtmissbrauch\" und \"sexuellen Übergriffen von Seiten des künstlerischen Leiters\"."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "74269505-b922-417d-affd-1e0c9b9de7f8",
                                                "sense_id": "3ee914e4-62ed-3a10-ae50-b9ab07d47fb3",
                                                "text": "Die Bundeskanzlerin [Angela Merkel] ist die voraussichtlich letzte Zeugin in dem Gremium [dem Abgas-Untersuchungsausschuss], das sich seit einem guten halben Jahr mit dem VW-Abgas-Skandal, seiner Vorgeschichte und seinen Folgen beschäftigt."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "573b3f7b-182f-47b3-b27a-cbc8eb735c11",
                        "source_entry_id": "7646c033-9d20-3bfc-bc07-80e926664df5",
                        "source_sense_id": "b47a6aaf-ee78-30cf-816c-4a65f714ad3a",
                        "target_lang_word": "witness",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "witness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f537f06e-abb5-3157-b8c0-0ea5103ec1d8",
                                        "entry_id": "8af1cb52-3b09-3468-9b70-07fe34100d58",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Attestation of a fact or event; testimony."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5180f91b-da28-4662-bcf3-d8d6ae8fd955",
                                                "sense_id": "f537f06e-abb5-3157-b8c0-0ea5103ec1d8",
                                                "text": "She can bear witness, since she was there at the time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1072935f-137c-43fa-9f97-846c4c9b53b6",
                                                "sense_id": "f537f06e-abb5-3157-b8c0-0ea5103ec1d8",
                                                "text": "May we, with the warrant of womanhood and the witness of a good conscience, pursue him with any further revenge?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb2daf5e-ab0f-4a38-9afd-c42df5e85228",
                                                "sense_id": "f537f06e-abb5-3157-b8c0-0ea5103ec1d8",
                                                "text": "We have as much witness from heaven as we need."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f21ffeb7-32d5-4e6f-af7e-2c15dde133cf",
                                                "sense_id": "f537f06e-abb5-3157-b8c0-0ea5103ec1d8",
                                                "text": "On another corner, stands an old style tenement building, whose dirty grey facade bears as much witness to the volume of exhaust fumes from millions of passing cars as it does to the age of the dwelling."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa9550c9-c401-45ba-ab00-802bf12e74d8",
                                                "sense_id": "f537f06e-abb5-3157-b8c0-0ea5103ec1d8",
                                                "text": "Nor do the formation and articulation of such knowledge themselves bear much witness to Geist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90275996-a57e-4756-b726-43ec195209ad",
                                                "sense_id": "f537f06e-abb5-3157-b8c0-0ea5103ec1d8",
                                                "text": "Fleeing is giving witness, and those that plead against it are loath to give so much witness"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65f61847-ea92-4917-afbb-0b976c710e46",
                                                "sense_id": "f537f06e-abb5-3157-b8c0-0ea5103ec1d8",
                                                "text": "Ob. 16 can show that every nation will get at least this much witness"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0055dea-907a-353d-8843-4f43e26bfaf5",
                                        "entry_id": "8af1cb52-3b09-3468-9b70-07fe34100d58",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who sees or has personal knowledge of something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6065a64-5de1-45eb-9a33-e2212f67508b",
                                                "sense_id": "d0055dea-907a-353d-8843-4f43e26bfaf5",
                                                "text": "As a witness to the event, I can confirm that he really said that."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c7ff531-2bf0-4098-9a03-bfab3dd68253",
                                                "sense_id": "d0055dea-907a-353d-8843-4f43e26bfaf5",
                                                "text": "[…]thyself art witness— I am betrothed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7796fe0f-e909-4fc0-ab2b-1320035bfa10",
                                                "sense_id": "d0055dea-907a-353d-8843-4f43e26bfaf5",
                                                "text": "Upon my looking round, I was a witness to appearances which filled me with melancholy and regret."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7dfb55a0-8790-347e-922f-3d60d7124ca3",
                                        "entry_id": "8af1cb52-3b09-3468-9b70-07fe34100d58",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone called to give evidence in a court."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "34e1aedc-706c-49d8-9cba-7f811fda711e",
                                                "sense_id": "7dfb55a0-8790-347e-922f-3d60d7124ca3",
                                                "text": "The witness for the prosecution did not seem very credible."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "37525518-b44f-4958-9153-678e183096aa",
                                                "sense_id": "7dfb55a0-8790-347e-922f-3d60d7124ca3",
                                                "text": "From the evidence of witnesses and of the recorded passing times, including the time at which the circuit breakers were tripped when the wires were brought down, the train was travelling at a speed of not less than 70 m.p.h."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1cebfee7-e105-388a-985a-b36a7c9a018d",
                                        "entry_id": "8af1cb52-3b09-3468-9b70-07fe34100d58",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who is called upon to witness an event or action, such as a wedding or the signing of a document."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "262c2ce9-56af-443a-88c4-75694e5fca85",
                                                "sense_id": "1cebfee7-e105-388a-985a-b36a7c9a018d",
                                                "text": "The bridesmaid and best man at a wedding typically serve as the witnesses."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08d220df-1c43-312e-bd3f-820174d9a866",
                                        "entry_id": "8af1cb52-3b09-3468-9b70-07fe34100d58",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that serves as evidence; a sign or token."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af4edabd-48e6-42d8-b006-656f19d1723d",
                                                "sense_id": "08d220df-1c43-312e-bd3f-820174d9a866",
                                                "text": "Laban said to Jacob, […] This heap be witness, and this pillar be witness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "witness",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6ec8aa0c-6dad-3f76-86e4-36fb1ce32476",
                                        "entry_id": "e9496a5d-94df-34c6-ac98-c30f174dc665",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To furnish proof of, to show."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a170e740-55cf-4aa5-b4c5-5a081c4a9fc7",
                                                "sense_id": "6ec8aa0c-6dad-3f76-86e4-36fb1ce32476",
                                                "text": "This certificate witnesses his presence on that day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09238c03-90f1-4e66-93d4-13781b819220",
                                                "sense_id": "6ec8aa0c-6dad-3f76-86e4-36fb1ce32476",
                                                "text": "round he throws his baleful eyes / That witness'd huge affliction and dismay"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d56e5414-e669-3dd8-a133-b9beb15c3a06",
                                        "entry_id": "e9496a5d-94df-34c6-ac98-c30f174dc665",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To take as evidence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d017c67-3567-416f-b050-0ec460953644",
                                                "sense_id": "d56e5414-e669-3dd8-a133-b9beb15c3a06",
                                                "text": "Depression often goes undetected until it is too late . Witness the recent White House suicide."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a990047f-cfac-32a2-a6a7-87ef9f858381",
                                        "entry_id": "e9496a5d-94df-34c6-ac98-c30f174dc665",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To see or gain knowledge of through experience."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a60f4ecf-86a1-439b-a071-4b0f5209cfcd",
                                                "sense_id": "a990047f-cfac-32a2-a6a7-87ef9f858381",
                                                "text": "He witnessed the accident."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b7ff526-d00d-4321-82be-56ece5822839",
                                                "sense_id": "a990047f-cfac-32a2-a6a7-87ef9f858381",
                                                "text": "This is but a faint sketch of the incalculable calamities and horrors we must expect, should we be so unfortunate as ever to witness the triumph of modern infidelity"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2fd9b4e-f6ed-400e-8288-3cf6c02fd15f",
                                                "sense_id": "a990047f-cfac-32a2-a6a7-87ef9f858381",
                                                "text": "General Washington did not live to witness the restoration of peace."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b44c9a92-e0b6-4cf6-bc57-b54105e9a001",
                                                "sense_id": "a990047f-cfac-32a2-a6a7-87ef9f858381",
                                                "text": "In 1825, the first public railway carried passengers across the English countryside, setting in motion not just an engineering revolution, but an industrial one too. Imagine the awe and excitement of those first passengers as they boarded the train, unaware that they were witnessing the dawn of a new era."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11206374-f695-30bf-b1a4-1df4f43a8571",
                                        "entry_id": "e9496a5d-94df-34c6-ac98-c30f174dc665",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To present personal religious testimony; to preach at (someone) or on behalf of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83e7eacd-81ba-43a8-ba35-c85923047dcf",
                                                "sense_id": "11206374-f695-30bf-b1a4-1df4f43a8571",
                                                "text": "Instead, Niebuhr's God was the God witnessed to in the Hebrew Scriptures and the New Testament, the Bible of the Christian world."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7096aa9b-1ae4-3c34-85cd-80ade82200ef",
                                        "entry_id": "e9496a5d-94df-34c6-ac98-c30f174dc665",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To see the execution of (a legal instrument), and subscribe it for the purpose of establishing its authenticity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e1a6c83-dd08-44ab-8355-923fb9094407",
                                                "sense_id": "7096aa9b-1ae4-3c34-85cd-80ade82200ef",
                                                "text": "to witness a bond or a deed"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
